# Version control and tooling
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Build output
**/bin
**/obj
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esult*
**/coverage
**/*.trx
**/artifacts

# Secrets and local config (never send to the build context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/appsettings.Local.json

# Not needed to build the images
tests
tools
docs
scripts
pack
.template.config
**/*.md
# ...except the LLM system prompt, an embedded resource of Conversia.Application (the build fails without it).
!src/Conversia.Application/Classification/Llm/system-prompt.es-CO.md
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
